.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
A bounded lock‑free multi‑producer, multi‑consumer (MPMC) queue\&. 

Producers and consumers coordinate through atomic sequence checks and CAS operations on \fRm_head\fP and \fRm_tail\fP\&.

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The type of items stored in the queue\&. 
.RE
.PP

